BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  # The Tale of the River's Gift) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The Upstream Village) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (     received fresh water first, while the Downstream Village awaited what flowed to them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  Each season, the River Spirit gave the Upstream Village five golden seeds. They faced a choice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    : plant the seeds on their own shore, or cast them into the waters. When seeds touched the r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    iver, the Spirit's magic tripled them, sending fifteen seeds downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  At first, Upstream Village kept all seeds for themselves, planting them in fear. Their gardens) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     grew modest. Downstream Village withered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  But one season, an elder cast all five seeds into the current. The Downstream Village rejoiced) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (     as fifteen seeds arrived. Grateful for this abundance, they returned ten seeds upstream, re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    cognizing that generosity had created wealth from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  Soon both villages flourished. Upstream learned that trusting the river multiplied their fortu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ne. Downstream understood that honoring trust sustained the cycle. When either village grew ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    selfish, both suffered. When both gave generously, the Spirit smiled, and prosperity flowed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    endlessly between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  The River Spirit whispered wisdom to all who would listen: "Wealth grows not from hoarding, bu) Tj ET
