BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The Upstream Vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        lage received fresh water first, while the Downstream Village awaited what flowed to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        m.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Each season, the River Spirit gave the Upstream Village five golden seeds. They faced a ch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        oice: plant the seeds on their own shore, or cast them into the waters. When seeds touch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ed the river, the Spirit's magic tripled them, sending fifteen seeds downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      At first, Upstream Village kept all seeds for themselves, planting them in fear. Their gar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        dens grew modest. Downstream Village withered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
