BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        ream, recognizing that generosity had created wealth from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      Soon both villages flourished. Upstream learned that trusting the river multiplied their f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        ortune. Downstream understood that honoring trust sustained the cycle. When either villa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        ge grew selfish, both suffered. When both gave generously, the Spirit smiled, and prospe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        rity flowed endlessly between them.) Tj ET
