BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        oice: plant the seeds on their own shore, or cast them into the waters. When seeds touch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ed the river, the Spirit's magic tripled them, sending fifteen seeds downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      At first, Upstream Village kept all seeds for themselves, planting them in fear. Their gar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        dens grew modest. Downstream Village withered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      But one season, an elder cast all five seeds into the current. The Downstream Village rejo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        iced as fifteen seeds arrived. Grateful for this abundance, they returned ten seeds upst) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        ream, recognizing that generosity had created wealth from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      Soon both villages flourished. Upstream learned that trusting the river multiplied their f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        ortune. Downstream understood that honoring trust sustained the cycle. When either villa) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        ge grew selfish, both suffered. When both gave generously, the Spirit smiled, and prospe) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        rity flowed endlessly between them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      The River Spirit whispered wisdom to all who would listen: "Wealth grows not from hoarding) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (        , but from the courage to trust and the wisdom to reciprocate.") Tj ET
